<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 585.36, up 1.05.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 300 to 249.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.03.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 22,588,850, compared with 22,744,080 Wednesday.</p>
<p>	     (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
